{title: Sons of Shem}
{subtitle: Genesis 10:7–28; 25:3; 1 Chronicles 1:9–32}
{key: Bb}
{tempo: 72}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [Bb] | [F/A] | [Gm7] [Bbmaj7/F] | [Eb] |
| [F] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Bb]From the sons of [F/A]Cush, [Gm7]Seba is named
[Eb]Havilah, [F]Sabtah, and Raa[Bb]mah
The sons of Raamah, [F/A]Sheba and Dedan [Gm7]
A line of [Eb]nations, [F]known by [Bb]name
Cush fathered Nimrod, mighty on [F]earth
A hunter [Gm]before the Lord, it is said [Eb]
Like [Bb]Nimrod, a mighty hun[F]ter
Kingdoms of [Eb]Babel, Erech, and Ak[Bb]kad
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Sons of Shem, the older broth[F]er
Father of [Gm]all the sons of E[Eb]ber
E[Bb]lam, Asshur, Arpachshad
[F]Lud, and A[Eb]ram, [F]by their [Bb]clans
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
Arpachshad fathered Shelah
[Gm]Shelah fathered Eber, the [Eb]line
Two sons were born to E[Bb]ber
Peleg, for the earth was divided
[Gm]Joktan fathered Almodad
[Eb]Sheleph, Hazarmaveth, Jerah
[F]Hadoram, Uzal, Dik[Eb]lah
O[F]bal, Abimael, and She[Bb]ba
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Sons of Shem, the older broth[F]er
Father of [Gm]all the sons of E[Eb]ber
E[Bb]lam, Asshur, Arpach[F]shad
Lud, and A[Eb]ram, by [F]their [Bb]clans
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
Jokshan fathered Sheba and Dedan
The [Gm]sons of Dedan, Asshurim
[Eb]Letushim, and Leummim [Bb]born
Keturah bore Zimran, Jok[Gm]shan
Medan, Midian, Ishbak, Shuah
[Eb]The lineage spreads, the [F]branches [Bb]grow
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
Shem, Arpachshad, Shelah
[F]Eber, Peleg, Reu, Serug
[Gm]Nahor, Terah, Abram
[Eb]That is Abraham, the father
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Sons of Shem, [Bb]the older broth[F]er
Father of [Gm]all the sons of E[Eb]ber
E[Bb]lam, Asshur, Arpachshad
[F]Lud, and A[Eb]ram, by [F]their [Bb]clans
